[0.267, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gthe section carries it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe executable knows neither its own revision nor the SDK's.\u001b[66G\u001b[22mR03\u001b[70Ghas\u001b[74Gto\u001b[77Gcompile\u001b[85Gboth\u001b[90Gin.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BA\u001b[5Ghosted\u001b[12Gsession\u001b[20Galso\u001b[25Grefuses\u001b[33Ga\u001b[35Gwritable\u001b[44Gmount,\u001b[51Gso\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gsnapshot\u001b[65Ggoes\u001b[70Gthrough\u001b[78G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCore::WriteFileDurably\u001b[39m,\u001b[102Gnot\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110GVFS's\u001b[116Guser\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmount. That is R02'\u001b[23G to prove.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDecision\u001b[12Gfor\u001b[16Gyou:\u001b[21GI\u001b[23Grecorded\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gcompatibility\u001b[50Grule\u001b[55Gas\u001b[58GD-111,\u001b[65Gmarked\u001b[72Gas\u001b[75Gmine\u001b[80Gand\u001b[84Gyours\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Greview.\u001b[101GBecause\u001b[109Gformats\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchange in place until play\u001b[30Gr\u001b[33Gesting, \u001b[42Ghe build is compared exactly.\u001b[72GThe catch is that\u001b[90Ga pers\u001b[97Gstent world\u001b[109Gd\u001b[111Ges not\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsurvive a\u001b[13Grebuild of Manif\u001b[30Gst or a pin move until then. If you want dev worlds\u001b[82Gto\u001b[85Gcarry ov\u001b[95G, th\u001b[100G rule \u001b[107Goosen\u001b[114Gt\u001b[116G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexact content an\u001b[21Gcomm\u001b[27Gds only,\u001b[37Gt the cost of a\u001b[53Gjournal possibly replaying under changed \u001b[95Gules.\u001b[101G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBesides\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gcontract,\u001b[25GI\u001b[27Gupdated\u001b[35GManifest's\u001b[46Gdelivery\u001b[55Gorder,\u001b[62Ghistory,\u001b[71Gdecision\u001b[80Gledger\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gsession\u001b[99Ghandoff,\u001b[108Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BJ\u001b[5Gttison's roadmap and history.\u001b[35G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2