[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m, which ENet splits into datagrams and\u001b[51Greassembles alre\u001b[68Gdy, so the limit is a setting a\u001b[100Ggame raises (`\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1BLimits::maxMe\u001b[26GsageBytes`). Measured on\u001b[51Gloopback: a\u001b[63Greli\u001b[68Gble\u001b[72Gmessage of 1\u001b[85GMiB arrives;\u001b[99Gn unreliable\u001b[112Gon\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Be, \u001b[18G fr\u001b[22Ggm\u001b[25Gnts sen\u001b[33G at onc\u001b[41G into the\u001b[51Greceiver's 256 KiB socket buffer,\u001b[85Garrived twenty times of twent\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1By at 192 \u001b[22Gnd 256\u001b[29GKiB and\u001b[37Gnev\u001b[41Gr a\u001b[45G 384 KiB or more. Past that a view wants deltas, not provisioned ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mar\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bchitecture\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](architecture.md#networking)). | Met: the `net` suite sends a 192 KiB snapshot and a 1 MiB \r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Breliable message and compares each byte for byte, thirty runs of thirty. |                            \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m370\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m        \u001b[21G       \u001b[29G   \u001b[33G        \u001b[42G    \u001b[47G    \u001b[52G   \u001b[56G     \u001b[62G      \u001b[69G    \u001b[74G  \u001b[77G       \u001b[85G \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 371 \u001b[22m Manifest's W18, W11 and W19 needed no engine edit, and later W12, W13 and W14 (2026-11-23), competitiv\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22me\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m372\u001b[12G\u001b[22mprocurement,\u001b[25Gregional\u001b[34Ggovernance\u001b[45Gand\u001b[49Gthe\u001b[53Gclose\u001b[59Gof\u001b[62Gits\u001b[66GStage\u001b[72G4,\u001b[75Gon\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gpin\u001b[86G`14fc23a`.\u001b[97GIts\u001b[101GR01\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22m(2026-11-24), the s\u001b[32Gve and compatibility\u001b[54Gontract, a planning task, needed none either and names\u001b[109Gno\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEngine\u001b[10Gcode,\u001b[16Gtests\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Gdocs\u001b[31Gare\u001b[35Gwritten;\u001b[44Gnow\u001b[48Gverifying\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gfsync\u001b[68Gorder\u001b[74Gunder\u001b[80Gstrace\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Grunning\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gper-commit\u001b[114Ggate.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m2\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpatterns,\u001b[29Greading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m6\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[46Glisting\u001b[54G\u001b[1m1\u001b[56G\u001b[22mdirectory,\u001b[67Grunning\u001b[75G\u001b[1m4\u001b[77G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[83Gcommands…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cat '../manifest/'source/game/remote/CMakeLists.txt; sed -n 30,70p \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'.\u001b[10Gman\u001b[14Gfe\u001b[17Gt/'source/game/remote/s\u001b[41Gc/Server.cpp\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
